msgid "[pcio_me_members]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Renders a read-only, searchable table of all members, including their email address and phone number. Requires a logged-in account that carries the vis_member capability — it renders nothing at all for visitors and for accounts without a member record. Any user with vis_member sees the full table; there is no per-member filtering."
msgstr ""

