msgid "[pcio_me_rolling_text]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Renders a scrolling marquee banner using texts that are scheduled in the Rolling Texts table. Only entries whose start/stop window includes the current server time are shown. Multiple simultaneous entries are joined by a long dash (—)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Manage entries at Vis → Calendar → Rolling Texts tab. You can have as many independent banners as you like by giving each a unique Roller ID and using a matching id attribute in the shortcode."
